      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Recruiting type 2 diabetes studies from ClinicalTrials.gov\nFind up to five type 2 diabetes studies whose registry status is `RECRUITING`. Compare sponsors, study phase, enrollment and the last registry update.\n\n1. Select a **Header Auth** credential on the HTTP Request node. Use header name `Authorization` and value `Bearer <your Apify token>`.\n2. Run once. Check the HTTP node for one JSON item per record or download `clinical-trials-studies.csv` from **Convert to CSV → Binary → data**. A Google Sheets **Append Row** node can also use the HTTP output.\n\nWith five saved results at the Free plan rate: **$0.01755**. The Actor charge cap is **$0.05** per run. Automatic HTTP retries are off. [Actor pricing](https://apify.com/perceptive_city_af7/clinical-trials-scraper/pricing).",
        "width": 790,
        "height": 270,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
